            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si chiama la variabile contatore in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  i += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nel codice non c'è alcuna variabile contatore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rinomini la variabile contatore da <code>i</code> a <code>step</code>. Quale modifica mantiene invariato il funzionamento del ciclo?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  i += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sostituisci <code>i</code> con <code>step</code> ovunque compaia.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sostituisci <code>i</code> solo nella prima riga.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sostituisci <code>i</code> solo nella condizione e nell'aggiornamento.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sostituisci <code>i</code> con <code>step</code> ovunque compaia.</p></body></html>",
