            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I numeri <code>0</code> , <code>1</code> e <code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">I numeri <code>1</code>, <code>2</code> e <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">I numeri <code>0</code>, <code>1</code>, <code>2</code> e <code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I numeri <code>0</code> , <code>1</code> e <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Così com'è scritto, questo ciclo visualizza <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> e <code>2</code>, come mostra la console. Che cosa farebbe se eliminassi la riga <code>counter += 1</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Visualizzerebbe <code>0</code> di continuo senza fermarsi.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Visualizzerebbe <code>0</code> una volta sola e poi si fermerebbe.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Visualizzerebbe comunque <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> e <code>2</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Visualizzerebbe <code>0</code> di continuo senza fermarsi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
