            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il ciclo qui sotto si ripete tre volte. Quale valore contiene <code>i</code> durante la terza e ultima ripetizione?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Polly wants a cracker!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nessuno, perché il corpo del ciclo non usa mai <code>i</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
